." Manpage for laptop-welcome
.TH LAPTOP-WELCOME 1 "August 2026" "1.0" "Laptop Welcome Subcommand Manual"
.SH NAME
laptop-welcome \- Show the laptop logo and maintenance status
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B laptop welcome
.SH DESCRIPTION
The welcome subcommand always displays the laptop logo and reports the number of days since setup, upgrade, and cleanup were last completed.
.PP
It warns when a command has never completed or when its configured interval has passed.
.SH INTERVALS
Intervals are measured in days. Environment variables take precedence over the laptop self configuration file:
.TP
.B LAPTOP_SETUP_INTERVAL
Fallback configuration key: setup_interval. Default: 7 days.
.TP
.B LAPTOP_UPGRADE_INTERVAL
Fallback configuration key: upgrade_interval. Default: 7 days.
.TP
.B LAPTOP_CLEANUP_INTERVAL
Fallback configuration key: cleanup_interval. Default: 30 days.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B laptop welcome
Display the logo and maintenance status.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR laptop (1),
.BR laptop-setup (1),
.BR laptop-upgrade (1),
.BR laptop-cleanup (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Written by jpolo.
